## Instructions

1. For each folder-group, load its injected `REVIEW.md` enforcement map.
2. Record the pre-computed deterministic findings first (precedence).
3. Judge only the `LLM`-detection rows from each `REVIEW.md`, with calibrated
   confidence.
4. Activate FD1-FD7 for any group whose language is `frontend`.
5. Apply the ADR.1 ratchet from the root `REVIEW.md` against the full file list.
6. Output exactly one `ReviewReport` JSON object (v1 schema).
